Package: distsfactory
Title: Construct Probability Distributions from Partial Specifications
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ron", "Ashri", role = "aut"),
    person("Sarat", "Moka", role = "aut"),
    person("Yoni", "Nazarathy", email = "yoni@accumulationpoint.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Construct probability distributions from partial specifications
    such as moments (mean, variance), quantiles, or mode. Wraps base R
    distribution functions (dnorm, pgamma, qbeta, etc.) and returns
    convenient distribution objects with d/p/q/r methods.
